{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"why-rope-over-absolute","content_sha256":"sha256:7a4e0bf7c769921f047b73bed348fb476adfc128bf1af0e4646b639f6b7a1246","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789956931.303249,"domain":"model-architecture","explanation":"RoPE 旋转注入相对位置,外推友好(配 YaRN)、无额外参数、易融合;可学习绝对编码受训练长度限、外推差。是高频对比题。","id":"q-arch-hot-why-rope-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"RoPE 通过对 Q/K 旋转把相对位置注入注意力,天然编码相对距离、对长度外推更友好(配 NTK/YaRN 可扩上下文),且不增加参数、易与注意力融合;可学习绝对位置编码受限于训练最大长度、外推差、且是额外可学习表"},{"id":"b","text":"RoPE 需要为每个位置学一个向量"},{"id":"c","text":"绝对位置编码外推能力更强"},{"id":"d","text":"RoPE 只能用于 encoder"}],"prompt":"面试高频：为什么现代 LLM 用 RoPE 而不是可学习的绝对位置编码?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"judgment","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"RoFormer (RoPE)","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.09864"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"transformer-block","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
